The container images built from this repository bundle third-party software that keeps its own license.
Every component allows redistribution. Where the license texts are, inside the images:
  - Debian packages: /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright (one per installed package), with the full GPL, LGPL,
    MPL and Apache texts in /usr/share/common-licenses/.
  - npm packages installed as node_modules (the manager, the CLI, sharp): each package's own license file.
  - Code shipped as a bundle without node_modules: /opt/deskhand/daemon/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt (desktop
    daemon) and /opt/deskhand/app/packages/dashboard/dist/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt (dashboard, also served at
    <base>/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt). Both are generated at build time by scripts/third-party-licenses.mjs.
  - This file and LICENSE: /usr/share/doc/deskhand/ in both images.

